# 1. THE PRODUCT VISION

Working product name: **GYMVERSE OS**

Tagline: **YOUR GYM. YOUR PEOPLE. YOUR ENTIRE FITNESS WORLD.**

Alternative brand line:

"Everything happening in your gym. All in one place."

The product consists of three connected experiences:

**GYMVERSE MEMBER:** A personalized application through which members discover their gym, access information, manage workouts, make friends, book services, track progress, and participate in gym life.

**GYMVERSE CONTROL:** A powerful operational dashboard for gym owners, managers, trainers, receptionists, maintenance teams, and other authorized staff.

**GYMVERSE INTELLIGENCE:** An AI-powered intelligence layer that organizes gym information, detects operational problems, answers questions, provides insights, and recommends appropriate actions.

All three products must share a coherent underlying data model and consistent permissions. When an authorized staff member updates a machine's status, changes a class schedule, or announces a closure, the relevant information must update throughout the application.

The platform must support an individual neighborhood gym just as thoughtfully as a luxury fitness club with hundreds of machines and thousands of members.

