# 25. TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE

Build a maintainable, secure, scalable application.

Preferred architecture when supported:

- Frontend: Next.js or an appropriate modern React framework.
- Language: TypeScript.
- Styling: Tailwind CSS and a coherent design-token system.
- Database: PostgreSQL.
- Authentication: a secure managed authentication service or equivalent.
- Backend: validated server-side APIs and business logic.
- Storage: suitable private and public object storage.
- Authorization: server-side role and resource checks.
- Monitoring: application errors and operational metrics.
- Payments: a supported payment provider.
- Deployment: an appropriate managed cloud platform.

Supabase may be evaluated for database, authentication, storage, and selected realtime functions. Vercel may be evaluated for deployment. Choose the smallest practical stack that satisfies the requirements.

