- Data minimization.
- Purpose-specific consent.
- Secure authentication.
- Role-based access control.
- Encryption in transit.
- Appropriate encryption at rest.
- Secure sessions.
- Input validation.
- Rate limiting.
- Secure file uploads.
- Audit logging.
- Backup and recovery procedures.
- Account export and deletion workflows.
- Sensitive-data access restrictions.
- Incident response planning.
- Consent withdrawal for optional features.
- Appropriate retention and deletion policies.

Keep staff records, health information, private messages, and financial information out of ordinary analytics logs.

Make social sharing opt-in, and allow members to delete or correct eligible information.

Obtain qualified legal review of applicable Indian privacy, consumer, employment, health-service, and payment requirements before launch.

