# 27. GYMVERSE ADMINISTRATION AND WHITE-LABEL MODE

The platform should support two commercial modes.

**Mode A: Branded gym application.** A gym can use the GYMVERSE platform with its own name, photographs, logo, branch details, and membership plans inside the unified member experience.

**Mode B: Dedicated gym experience.** Eligible business customers can receive a more customized, gym-branded application experience according to their subscription and supported deployment model.

Do not promise a completely separate app-store application for every business unless the technical, publishing, and commercial requirements are implemented.

