# THE ULTIMATE PRODUCT STANDARD

When a member asks, "What's happening in my gym?", the application should be able to provide an accurate answer from authorized, current information.

When a member asks, "Can I find someone to train with?", the system should provide an opt-in, respectful way to discover compatible people.

When an owner asks, "What requires my attention today?", the dashboard should surface the most important confirmed operational issues.

When a machine breaks, the appropriate people should know, the problem should be tracked, and the equipment should not be returned to service without appropriate authorization.

When a class changes, affected members should receive accurate information.

When the gym expands, its operational data and permissions should scale with it.

The product must connect equipment, people, services, information, and business operations into one coherent system.

**Build the gym's complete digital brain, not just its digital noticeboard.**

